WEBVTT

00:00:02.205 --> 00:00:05.041
Merry Christmas merry Christmas

00:00:05.291 --> 00:00:08.044
ring the hogwart bell

00:00:08.294 --> 00:00:11.047
merry Christmas merry Christmas

00:00:11.297 --> 00:00:14.217
cast 3 Christmas spell

00:00:27.814 --> 00:00:31.151
Knight to e5.

00:00:38.825 --> 00:00:40.994
Queen to e5.

00:00:46.583 --> 00:00:48.042
That's totally barbaric!

00:00:48.668 --> 00:00:52.213
That's wizard's chess.
I see you've packed.

00:00:52.422 --> 00:00:53.882
I see you haven't.

00:00:54.257 --> 00:00:59.387
Change of plans. My parents went
to Romania to visit my brother Charlie.

00:00:59.596 --> 00:01:03.433
- He's studying dragons there.
- Good. You can help Harry.

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:07.020
He's going to the library
to look up Nicholas flamel.

00:01:07.228 --> 00:01:10.732
We've looked a hundred times!

00:01:11.357 --> 00:01:16.613
Not in the restricted section.
Happy Christmas.

00:01:18.823 --> 00:01:21.743
I think we've had
a bad influence on her.

00:01:24.287 --> 00:01:28.625
Ron: Harry, wake up!
Come on, Harry, wake up!

00:01:38.468 --> 00:01:41.804
- Happy Christmas, Harry.
- Happy Christmas, Ron.

00:01:41.971 --> 00:01:44.224
What are you wearing?

00:01:44.807 --> 00:01:48.478
Oh, my mum made it.
Looks like you've got one too.

00:01:49.646 --> 00:01:52.065
- I've got presents?
- Yeah.

00:01:59.489 --> 00:02:01.574
Ron: There they are.

00:02:12.585 --> 00:02:16.089
"Your father left this
in my possession before he died.

00:02:16.339 --> 00:02:20.468
It is time it was returned to you.
Use it well."

00:02:37.277 --> 00:02:40.989
- What is it?
- Some kind of cloak.

00:02:41.281 --> 00:02:44.200
Well, let's see, then. Put it on.

00:02:49.622 --> 00:02:50.915
My body's gone!

00:02:51.124 --> 00:02:54.711
I know what that is.
That's an invisibility cloak!

00:02:55.211 --> 00:02:57.171
I'm invisible?

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:02.051
They're really rare.
I wonder who gave it to you.

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:07.307
There was no name.
It just said, "use it well."

00:03:35.376 --> 00:03:41.257
Famous fire-eaters.
Fifteenth-century fiends.

00:03:41.466 --> 00:03:47.263
Flamel. Nicholas flamel.
Where are you?

00:04:06.115 --> 00:04:08.034
Filch: Who's there?

00:04:14.123 --> 00:04:19.796
I know you're in there.
You can't hide.

00:04:27.136 --> 00:04:30.932
Who is it? Show yourself.

00:05:18.104 --> 00:05:19.480
Quirrell: Severus, I...

00:05:20.148 --> 00:05:24.026
You don't want me
as your enemy, quirrell.

00:05:24.193 --> 00:05:28.948
- I don't know what you mean.
- You know perfectly well what I mean.

00:05:46.174 --> 00:05:49.385
We'll have another little chat soon.

00:05:49.594 --> 00:05:55.057
When you've had time to decide
where your loyalties lie.

00:05:55.308 --> 00:05:59.729
Professors. I found this
in the restricted section.

00:06:00.229 --> 00:06:05.318
It's still hot. That means
there's a student out of bed.

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:39.245
Mum?
